# finisher (Skyy 2026-10-24 Farming XP / SkyyCollections 0.2.33 CollSwing.ripe): DynamicSeasons (pack, ON) ends a crop's growth in a QUALITY
# state - Crude / StageFinal / Best / Epic. RIPE = a state with a Harvest drop on a block that has a StageFinal state; every ripe state is
