# -> retry every 1 s; after 30 tries the occupied cells become single waiting blocks (D lines, placeholder Empty) that follow when free.
# Trunks bottom up, then leaves (the shape's order); a cell already holding its block is skipped, a cell holding something else is left +
# logged; a failed write also becomes a single waiting block (retried every 5 s). Then W line (grown back). Returns the blocks written.
